 "notes": [
  "Converted from the preset: each pad's sample parts for its note, Key Zone Shift and Sample Selector as stored; velocity zones become layers, a crossfade a switch where a part falls below half its level (a fade at the velocity range's edge keeps playing). gainDb = pad and chain faders + Simpler volume + part volume; Vel as law 'simpler'.",
  "Not reproduced: the instruments' envelopes (every sample plays its region to the end), filters (only their drive), the pads' other devices (none) and the devices around the Drum Rack (DrumBuss, StereoGain).",
  "Pulled down to 6 dB over the kit's median pad at velocity 127 (-8.7 dBFS before the drums' strip), by the pad's gainDb, its layers as the preset sets them: 39 Snare 2 Dry Session -2.1 dBFS, -0.59 dB. A pad far over the rest is out of the kit's balance, and SA's drums have no limiter: with the loop on top it can drive the master into its clip."
 ]
}
